<section class="page config-page" id="page-config">
          <div class="page-toolbar"><div><p class="breadcrumb-inline">系统 / 对接配置</p><h2>对接配置</h2><p>管理数据库、游戏连接和授权账号。</p></div></div>
          <div class="tabs config-tabs" role="tablist"><button class="tab active" data-config-tab="basic">数据存储</button><button class="tab" data-config-tab="rcon">配置连接</button><button class="tab" data-config-tab="auth">授权账号</button></div>
          <div class="tab-panel active" id="config-basic">
            <form id="basicConfigForm" class="card form-card config-database-card">
              <div class="card-head"><div><span class="config-card-index">01</span><h3>MySQL 数据库</h3><p>保存商品、玩家账户、订单和任务数据；修改连接参数后需重启服务。</p></div><strong id="mysqlPasswordState">读取中</strong></div>
              <div class="form-grid cols-3"><label>主机地址<input name="mysqlHost" placeholder="127.0.0.1"></label><label>端口<input name="mysqlPort" type="number" min="1" max="65535" placeholder="3306"></label><label>用户名<input name="mysqlUser" placeholder="scum_store"></label><label>数据库<input name="mysqlDatabase" placeholder="scum_store"></label><label class="span-2">密码<input name="mysqlPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空保留当前密码"><span class="field-hint">已配置密码不会在页面中显示。</span></label></div>
              <div class="form-actions"><span class="save-note">仅保存数据库连接参数</span><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存数据库配置</button></div>
            </form>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-panel" id="config-rcon">
            <div class="config-stack rcon-config-stack">
              <form id="panelApiConfigForm" class="card form-card rcon-config-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="config-card-index">01</span><h3>服务器面板 API</h3><p>配置服务器实例发现服务的连接参数。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-test="gsm3">测试连接</button></div><div class="form-grid cols-3"><label class="span-2">基础地址<input name="gsm3BaseUrl" type="url" required></label><label>请求超时（毫秒）<input name="gsm3TimeoutMs" type="number" min="500" max="120000"></label><label class="span-3">API Key <span class="hint" id="gsm3KeyState"></span><input name="gsm3ApiKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空保留当前密钥"></label></div><div class="form-actions"><span class="save-note">仅保存服务器面板连接参数</span><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存面板配置</button></div></form>
              <form id="scumRconConfigForm" class="card form-card rcon-config-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="config-card-index">02</span><h3>SCUM RCON</h3><p id="bridgeConfigDescription">由当前桥接模式提供游戏连接；管道模式下不会在此切换或覆盖为 TCP RCON。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-test="ggcon">测试连接</button></div><div class="bridge-capabilities" id="bridgeCapabilities"><span>宿主在线<b data-cap="host">检测中</b></span><span>IPC 认证<b data-cap="ipcAuth">检测中</b></span><span>玩家查询<b data-cap="players">检测中</b></span><span>消息<b data-cap="message">检测中</b></span><span>物品发放<b data-cap="giveItem">检测中</b></span><span>自动发货就绪<b data-cap="fulfillment">检测中</b></span><p data-bridge-reason>正在读取桥接状态</p></div><div class="form-grid cols-3" id="tcpRconFields"><label>连接方式<select name="discoveryMode"><option value="manual">手动 Host / Port</option></select></label><label>Host<input name="rconHost" placeholder="127.0.0.1"></label><label>Port<input name="rconPort" type="number" min="28015" max="28015" value="28015" readonly title="SCUM/RCON 端口固定为 28015"></label><label class="span-3">SCUM 游戏主目录 <span class="hint" id="scumGameDirectoryState"></span><input name="scumGameDirectory" placeholder="例如 D:\\SCUM\\10318\\SCUM"><span class="field-hint">保存后自动定位击杀/聊天日志，并读取游戏端 RCON Host、Port 和密钥。</span></label><label class="span-3">RCON 密码 <span class="hint" id="rconPasswordState"></span><span class="inline-fields"><input name="rconPassword" type="text" autocomplete="off" readonly placeholder="请先点击自动生成密钥"><button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="generateRconPassword">自动生成密钥</button></span><span class="field-hint">生成后保存可同步更新游戏端与商城配置；保存后需重启 SCUM 游戏服务端。</span></label></div><div class="form-actions"><span class="save-note">仅保存游戏目录、Host、Port 与密钥</span><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存配置连接</button></div></form>
              <form id="rconPolicyConfigForm" class="card form-card rcon-config-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="config-card-index">03</span><h3>连接与超时</h3><p>只允许本机 Host。网络读命令可重连；发货命令写入后不会自动重发。</p></div><label class="switch"><input name="reconnectEnabled" type="checkbox"><span></span>启用重连</label></div><div class="form-grid cols-3"><label>连接超时<span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="connectTimeoutMs" type="number" min="100" max="120000"><b>毫秒</b></span><span class="field-hint">建立 RCON 网络连接时允许等待的最长时间。</span></label><label>认证超时<span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="authTimeoutMs" type="number" min="100" max="120000"><b>毫秒</b></span><span class="field-hint">连接建立后等待密码认证完成的最长时间。</span></label><label>命令超时<span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="commandTimeoutMs" type="number" min="100" max="120000"><b>毫秒</b></span><span class="field-hint">发送命令后等待服务器完整响应的最长时间。</span></label><label>最大包<span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="maxPacketSize" type="number" min="64" max="16777216"><b>字节</b></span><span class="field-hint">单个 RCON 响应允许接收的最大数据量。</span></label><label>最大尝试<span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="maxAttempts" type="number" min="1" max="10"><b>次</b></span><span class="field-hint">连接失败时一次操作允许执行的最大尝试次数。</span></label><label>重试延迟<span class="rcon-policy-delay-fields"><span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="baseDelayMs" type="number" min="0" aria-label="基础延迟" placeholder="基础"><b>毫秒</b></span><span class="rcon-policy-input-unit"><input name="maxDelayMs" type="number" min="0" aria-label="延迟上限" placeholder="上限"><b>毫秒</b></span></span><span class="field-hint">重试等待从基础延迟逐步增加，但不会超过延迟上限。</span></label></div><div class="form-actions"><span class="save-note">仅保存超时与重连策略</span><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存连接策略</button></div></form>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-panel" id="config-auth"><section class="card license-account-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>授权账号</h3><p>查看当前商城程序连接的授权中心账号与授权有效期。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" id="reloadLicenseAccount" type="button">刷新状态</button></div><div class="license-account-state" id="licenseAccountState"><span class="license-account-badge waiting">读取中</span><strong>正在读取授权信息</strong><small>请稍候</small></div><dl class="license-account-details"><div><dt>授权账号</dt><dd id="licenseAccountUsername">--</dd></div><div><dt>授权状态</dt><dd id="licenseAccountStatus">--</dd></div><div><dt>授权到期</dt><dd id="licenseAccountExpiresAt">--</dd></div><div><dt>最近验证</dt><dd id="licenseAccountVerifiedAt">--</dd></div><div class="full"><dt>授权中心</dt><dd id="licenseAccountCenter">--</dd></div></dl><div class="license-account-note">授权令牌和账号密码不会在后台页面显示。</div></section></div>
        </section>

